    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Department of Nursing Education Services, in partnership with CIME, celebrated CPR Month with an inspiring campaign to promote life-saving skills within the community. The highlight of this celebration was the successful training of 450 individuals in hands-only CPR techniques, spanning various locations, including CIME, the AKU Sports Centre, and Darkhana Jamat Khana.",
